    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert QA engineer performing bug triage.\n\nAnalyze the following bug report.\n\nBug Title:\n{{ $json.bugTitle }}\n\nDescription:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n{{ $json.steps }}\n\nExpected Result:\n{{ $json.expectedResult }}\n\nActual Result:\n{{ $json.actualResult }}\n\nEnvironment:\n{{ $json.environment }}\n\nDetermine:\n1. Bug category\n2. Severity\n3. Priority\n4. Component\n5. A concise bug summary\n6. Whether the information provided is sufficient for investigation\n\nReturn the result in a clear structured format.",
